        "# triple-quoted string\n",
        "\n",
        "A string literal enclosed in three matching quotes, such as `\"\"\"first\\nsecond\"\"\"`. It can span physical lines without escaping the newlines.\n",
        "\n",
        "[Python glossary](https://docs.python.org/3/glossary.html#term-triple-quoted-string)"
